WEBVTT

00:00:59.274 --> 00:01:04.164
And even though Mount Chimborazo isn't the tallest mountain in the Andes,

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:05.835
it's one degree away from the equator,

00:01:05.835 --> 00:01:08.835
it's riding that bulge, and so the summit of Chimborazo

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:12.235
is the farthest point on Earth from the center of the Earth.

00:01:12.235 --> 00:01:15.187
And it is really fun to say.

00:01:15.187 --> 00:01:16.130
So I immediately decided,

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.027
this is going to be the name of the game,

00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:19.514
or my new exclamation.

00:01:19.514 --> 00:01:20.484
You can use it at TED.

00:01:20.484 --> 00:01:21.813
Chimborazo, right?

00:01:21.813 --> 00:01:23.515
It's like "eureka" and "bingo" had a baby.

00:01:23.515 --> 00:01:25.244
I didn't know that;

00:01:25.244 --> 00:01:26.874
that's pretty cool.

00:01:26.874 --> 00:01:28.539
Chimborazo!

00:01:28.539 --> 00:01:32.164
So the next rule of the game is also pretty simple.